# AskQuestion UI (repo-wide — not chat prose)

A question with two or more fixed answers uses Cursor's `AskQuestion` tool
when it is in the tool list. Never a numbered or bulleted menu in chat,
never "reply with 1 / 2 / 3", and never a menu beside the buttons.

- One `AskQuestion` per message. Batch related questions (intake: max 3).
- Do not add your own "Other…". Cursor appends one. Closed pairs get none.
- A single paste request (Figma URL, ticket key, free text) can be one chat line.
- No `AskQuestion` tool: do not stop or tell them to switch models. One honesty line, the same question in plain text with the options spelled out, then wait. No substance meanwhile.

Full contract and scripted payloads: `harness/references/ask-question-ui.md`.
